SUMMARY:Dorian Blue Jazz - Live Music at The Log Cabin
DESCRIPTION:Dorian Blue Jazz is dedicated to bringing classic jazz standards to life with warmth\, swing\, and timeless elegance. Featuring Bill Druck on guitar and Bryan Hoke on saxophone\, the group channels the relaxed sophistication and lyrical interplay of the iconic Jim Hall/Paul Desmond recordings. The combo is rounded out by a guest bassist\, with different bassists appearing from performance to performance—adding variety\, spontaneity\, and fresh musical interplay each time they take the stage. \nBill and Bryan share a deep love for the Great American Songbook\, delivering performances that are both intimate and engaging\, making Dorian Blue Jazz an ideal accompaniment to your dinner at the Log Cabin restaurant. \nThe duo’s musical connection goes back decades. Bill and Bryan originally performed together as Dorian Blue in the 1980s\, developing a tight musical rapport and shared vision for jazz rooted in melody and feel. After a long hiatus\, they’ve reunited\, picking up right where they left off—playing together as if they never missed a beat. With experience\, chemistry\, and a rotating lineup of guest bassists\, Dorian Blue Jazz offers a sound that is both nostalgic and fresh. \n\nThings To Do for Adults & Couples in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nBreweries\n\n\n\nFactory Tours\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/dorian-blue-jazz-log-cabin/
LOCATION:Log Cabin Restaurant\, 11 Lehoy Forest Dr\, Leola\, 17540\, United States
