SUMMARY:Spring Shopping on the Farm - Cherry-Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:A Perfect Way to Celebrate Mother’s Day!\nJoin us on Saturday\, May 9th from 9AM–4PM at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm for a relaxing and fun-filled spring day on the farm!\nThis FREE\, rain-or-shine event is open to the public and features a wonderful mix of local vendors\, delicious food\, and family-friendly experiences.\nWhat to Expect:\n\nShop Local – Browse unique finds from talented local vendors featuring handmade goods\, home décor\, boutique items\, plants\, flowers\, and more\nPetting Zoo – Spend time with our friendly farm animals\nHighland Cow Photos – Snap a memorable photo with our adorable Highland cows\nFood & Drinks – Enjoy tasty bites and refreshing drinks\nCherry Crest Stores Open – Shop our farm store for treats\, gifts\, and seasonal favorites\n\nWhether you’re shopping for Mom\, bringing her along\, or just enjoying a spring day together\, this is a great way to celebrate!\n\nPlease Note: Cherry Crest Adventure Farm attractions will NOT be open during this event.\n\nWe can’t wait to welcome you to the farm for a beautiful day of shopping\, food\, and family fun!\n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
