SUMMARY:Treat Mom Event at Kitchen Kettle Village
DESCRIPTION:Treat Mom Event at Kitchen Kettle Village!\n\nJoin us at Kitchen Kettle Village for our Treat Mom Event on Saturday\, May 9th from 9am–6pm.\n\nWhether it’s your mom\, grandma\, sister\, or a special friend — treat the important women in your life to a day filled with joy! Stroll through our scenic outdoor village and explore one-of-a-kind shops offering special treats just for her.\n\nDon’t Miss the FREE Shopping Spree Passport! Pick up a passport at the hospitality tent (10am-4pm)\, visit all the participating shops\, collect their signatures\, and return your completed paper back to the tent or in one of the shops to enter a giveaway for a $300 gift basket! (No purchases required!)\n\nIt’s the perfect way to spend quality time and celebrate someone special. We can’t wait to see you there!
