SUMMARY:Mother's Day at The Log Cabin
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother’s Day this year with a Sunday meal at The Log Cabin! \nHonor the wonderful mothers in your life and let us do the cooking. Our Mother’s Day meal is a cherished tradition\, featuring a special Holiday Menu designed by Chef Painter. Guests may order à la carte\, selecting from a variety of seasonal favorites. \nWe are happy to accommodate parties of all sizes and have several rooms available for private dining upon request. If your party includes children or individuals with limited mobility\, please let us know in advance and we will do our absolute best to accommodate. \n\nThings To Do for Adults & Couples in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nBreweries\n\n\n\nFactory Tours\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
